- Haiku BFS attributes, selective indexing, and live-query ideas:
  https://www.haiku-os.org/legacy-docs/practical-file-system-design.pdf
- Linux cgroup v2, blk-mq, and wait-queue documentation:
  https://docs.kernel.org/admin-guide/cgroup-v2.html
  https://docs.kernel.org/block/blk-mq.html
  https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/kernel/sched/wait.c
